### Correct credentials
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@carrepair.com",
  "password": "alok"
}

### Wrong password
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@carrepair.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Non-admin email
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "someuser@carrepair.com",
  "password": "anypassword"
}